        "question": "### Exercise 17.4: Find the mean of a data set\n\n3. Find the mean value of the following data set. Round your answer to two decimal places.\n\n$$\n\\text{8; 7; 10; 8; 7; 6; 5; 5; 6; 11}\n$$",
